<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (People who cannot speak use hand signs to communicate, but most people do not understand sign language. Blind people also cannot see these signs. Because of this, it becomes difficult for mute and blind individuals to communicate with others. So, we need a system that can look at a hand sign, understand it, and convert it into text and speech to make communication easier for everyone.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
